    <content>
      <Value><![CDATA[# The Dawn of Autonomous Content Management

Websites are no longer static repositories of hand-written code. We are entering the **agentic era**, where AI models don't just write copy or draft mockups—they design schemas, write Razor templates, and orchestrate deployments autonomously.

## What is an Agentic CMS?
An agentic CMS is a standard Content Management System (like Umbraco) connected to a large language model through structured protocols. The AI can:
1. Query document structures.
2. Create and modify content nodes.
3. Edit local stylesheets and views to adjust the aesthetic.
4. Run regression tests and accessibility checks in real-time.

By coupling Umbraco's flexible backend with an intelligent agent, we turn the CMS into a living, breathing digital organism.]]></Value>
    </content>
